<title>USA: Dade County okays $450 million revenue bond.</title>
<headline>Dade County okays $450 million revenue bond.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dade County Commission on Tuesday authorized a $450 million water and sewer bond to be priced in January, a commission official said.</p>
<p>A vote of the 13 commissioners was not immediately available, according to Chip Iglesias, chief of staff for Commissioner Jimmy Morales.</p>
<p>-- Michael Connor - Miami newsroom, 305-374-5013</p>
